{
 "record": "2026-09-28-aas-portal-reachability-index.md",
 "date": "2026-09-28",
 "change": {
  "file": "code/botlib/be_aas_sample.cpp",
  "function": "AAS_PointReachabilityAreaIndex",
  "before": "cluster = aasworld.portals[-cluster].frontcluster; areanum = aasworld.portals[-cluster].clusterareanum[0]; -- the second read goes through the front cluster just assigned, portals[-frontcluster]",
  "after": "const int portalnum = -cluster; cluster = aasworld.portals[portalnum].frontcluster; areanum = aasworld.portals[portalnum].clusterareanum[0];",
  "foundBy": "the navigation loaders' index-check work of 2026-09-28 (2026-09-28-aas-index-checks.md, \"Found along the way\")",
  "loaderChecks": "code/botlib/aas_index_checks.hpp (c8d3bbb, landed just before this change) refuses a file unless an area whose cluster is negative is the area of the portal it names (-cluster below numportals), every portal's clusters are inside the cluster table, and each portal's number in each cluster it joins is one of that cluster's numbers; with it, every read the portal branch makes for an accepted file is inside a table. This change adds no check."
 },
 "profilesReachingTheFunction": [
  "q3",
  "ql"
 ],
 "profilesRefusingTheImport": {
  "rtcw-sp": "ordinal 578: SV_RTCWGameSharedCall has no mapping, ERR_DROP \"Unsupported rtcw-sp game import 578 (BOTLIB_AAS_POINT_REACHABILITY_AREA_INDEX)\"; RTCW's released sv_game.c has no case",
  "rtcw-mp": "ordinal 578: as rtcw-sp",
  "wolfet": "ordinal 578: SV_WolfETGameCall default, ERR_DROP \"Unsupported WolfET game import 578\"; ET's released sv_game.c has no case",
  "stvef-mp": "no ordinal: Holomatch's game imports end at 572; SV_STVEFGameCall answers \"Bad game system trap\"",
  "jka-mp": "ordinal 577: SV_JKAGameCall has no case, ERR_DROP \"Jedi Academy game import ... is not served yet\"",
  "jk2-mp": "no table: SV_JK2GameCall serves only named numbers, ERR_DROP \"Jedi Outcast game import 577 is not served yet\""
 },
